// An exact catalog line is named. A nearer sketch is not.
// The rank stays. Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE fetch ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG fetch law

IMPULSE fetch 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "fetch" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
